    "result_text": "The full build succeeds. The project's only test class is `AcceptanceTest`, and both of its tests pass.\n\n## Summary\n\nI implemented the `contactPreference` field on the owner response so it returns `EMAIL` when an email is present, otherwise `PHONE`:\n\n1. **`ContactPreference.java`** (new) \u2014 a small helper mirroring the existing `Locality`/`MembershipLevel` derivation classes: `of(email)` returns `\"EMAIL\"` when email is non-null/non-blank, else `\"PHONE\"`.\n\n2. **`openapi.yml`** \u2014 added the `contactPreference` string property to the `Owner` schema (read-only), so the generated `OwnerDto` carries the field.\n\n3. **`OwnerMapper.java`** \u2014 added a `@Mapping` expression targeting `contactPreference`, computed from `owner.getEmail()` via the new helper, following the same pattern as `locality` and `membershipLevel`.\n\nThe response flows through the existing `RespondWithOwner` \u2192 `OwnerMapper.toOwnerDto` pipeline, so both the `POST /api/owners` create response and `GET /api/owners/{id}` include the field. Full suite: `Tests run: 2, Failures: 0, Errors: 0` \u2014 BUILD SUCCESS.",
